%description:
TR 38.901 clause 7.4.3.1 gives an outdoor-to-indoor building penetration loss for the Indoor
Factory too ("Only the high-loss model is applicable to InF"), and the model does not have it:
the InF formulas are those of a link inside the hall. A UE with insideBuilding = true in an InF
cell would be evaluated without a wall, without a message. The first evaluation of such a link is
an error. A hall served from outdoors is an urban cell with an indoor UE and
useBuildingPenetrationHighLossModel.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.gnb*.scenario = "INDOOR_FACTORY_SL"
# clutter-embedded antennas: both below the 2 m clutter height of the scenario's default
*.gnb.cellularNic.antenna.mobility.offsetZ = 1.5m
*.ue[*].insideBuilding = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
is inside a building (insideBuilding), and the building penetration loss of TR 38.901 for the scenario INDOOR_FACTORY_SL is not implemented
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
